      "updated": 1786374256805,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Usually the real limit. A 2,500 lb rack on a 36 x 42 in\nfootprint is roughly 240 lb/sq ft - well past a typical\n100 lb/sq ft office slab",
      "originalText": "Usually the real limit. A 2,500 lb rack on a 36 x 42 in footprint is roughly 240 lb/sq ft - well past a typical 100 lb/sq ft office slab",
