      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cup or flange washers on painted rails stop the head from chipping the coating. A chipped edge is where corrosion starts.",
      "originalText": "Cup or flange washers on painted rails stop the head from chipping the coating. A chipped edge is where corrosion starts.",
