      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786374231035,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Torque figures are TYPICAL, for use where the\nequipment manufacturer publishes none. Where the\nmanufacturer does publish a value, that value\ngoverns. A calibrated driver is a cheap tool.",
      "originalText": "1. Torque figures are TYPICAL, for use where the equipment manufacturer publishes none. Where the manufacturer does publish a value, that value governs. A calibrated driver is a cheap tool.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 138,
      "versionNonce": 557469233,
      "index": "b4P",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e337",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1668.5714285714284,
      "y": 1408,
      "width": 328.57142857142895,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786374218710,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Specify square-hole rails and stock M6 cage\nnuts and screws as the house standard. Keep\none bin of 10-32 for legacy gear, labeled.",
      "originalText": "2. Specify square-hole rails and stock M6 cage nuts and screws as the house standard. Keep one bin of 10-32 for legacy gear, labeled.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 64,
      "versionNonce": 1243482897,
      "index": "b4Q",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e338",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1668.5714285714284,
      "y": 1473,
      "width": 318.5714285714285,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786374221865,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Record the rail type and thread in the\nrack documentation. The next person will not\nbe you.",
      "originalText": "3. Record the rail type and thread in the rack documentation. The next person will not be you.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
